WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.620
Because I think we have been the David in just about all of these battles.

2
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:17.260
Unfortunately, the goliaths are people that are using our resources, our tax dollars, jobs that we have provided them.

3
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.540
And they have tried to destroy us with our own resources.
